        <mxCell id="7SXduU8boftrjlnVp-gB-40" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Por que é inadequada?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;• aumenta a exposição de credenciais e dados&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;• permite acesso direto à estrutura do banco&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;• dificulta centralizar regras de negócio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;• aumenta o acoplamento do frontend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;• expõe integrações externas ao cliente&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
